        "id": "RenataPassive",
        "name": "Leverage",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Renata's Attacks deal bonus damage and mark enemies. Renata's allies can damage marked enemies to deal bonus damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "Renata's Attacks mark enemies for 6 seconds and deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">((1% ~ 1.52%) + (0.02% Ability Power)) max Health magic damage</span> if they were unmarked.<br /><br />Allied champions' Attacks or Abilities consume the mark, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">((1% ~ 1.52%) + (0.02% Ability Power)) max Health magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Renata may only have one target marked at a time.</span>",
